What might a kindergartner need for back to school? According to one mom on TikTok, at least $2,000 worth of gear.

TJ, or @thetjjedit on TikTok, shared a haul of all the back-to-school shopping she did for her kindergarten-age daughter earlier this month. The haul included multiple pairs of shoes, lunchboxes and containers, a customized backpack set and even Starbucks gift cards for teachers. TJ's daughter also goes to a private school, so the co

